{"title":"2023 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2023 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5\">2023 AMC 10A #5</a> and <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2023 AMC 12A #4</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Only_if_you_don&#39;t_know_how_to_do_the_rest_of_the_problems_and_have_about_20_minutes_left,_IT_IS_NOT_recommended)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Only if you don't know how to do the rest of the problems and have about 20 minutes left, IT IS NOT recommended)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Similar_to_Solution_1)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Similar to Solution 1)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(easy_to_digest)_by_Power_Solve\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (easy to digest) by Power Solve</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_CosineMethod_[🔥Fast_and_Easy🔥]\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by CosineMethod [🔥Fast and Easy🔥]</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(⚡_Under_2_min_⚡)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (⚡ Under 2 min ⚡)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_Fast_and_Easy_by_DR.GOOGLE\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution Fast and Easy by DR.GOOGLE</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many digits are in the base-ten representation of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/c/dcc6d6787e3535d659daa40a8af881beccd14857.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^5 \\cdot 5^{10} \\cdot 15^5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"93\" height=\"17\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/5/645a48339d8c0b89526d51bfc39fa5e7e77a0869.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 14 \\qquad\\textbf{(B) }15 \\qquad\\textbf{(C) }16 \\qquad\\textbf{(D) }17 \\qquad\\textbf{(E) } 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"401\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Prime factorizing this gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/3/5c3f0c55ff7405ecc90afbca79174680fc90e5bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{15}\\cdot3^{5}\\cdot5^{15}=10^{15}\\cdot3^5=243\\cdot10^{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"274\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/2/232d623333bab3beb668148e2ad72e3a625209b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"30\" height=\"15\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> digits and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/2/0d283696fa15299ba194e896dd5a3a6c709edde1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$243$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/6/9f670a79f24aea9bb52e51edc94723ba617518ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2.43*10^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"77\" height=\"17\" /> gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more digits. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/3/093618546dace4f22aabec750628d9a9413ee2f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16+2=\\text{\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }18}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"139\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/8/348260d2f278df43de4c942e81b1d1cc8f6c0f20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2.43*10^{17}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/7/5e7a1b6098a8c98b8e4adae526aeef4b91712620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> digits\n</p><p>~zhenghua\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Only_if_you_don.27t_know_how_to_do_the_rest_of_the_problems_and_have_about_20_minutes_left.2C_IT_IS_NOT_recommended.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Only_if_you_don't_know_how_to_do_the_rest_of_the_problems_and_have_about_20_minutes_left,_IT_IS_NOT_recommended)\">Solution 2 (Only if you don't know how to do the rest of the problems and have about 20 minutes left, IT IS NOT recommended)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Only if you don&#39;t know how to do the rest of the problems and have about 20 minutes left, IT IS NOT recommended)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Multiplying it out, we get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/3/d43b26fca33de590bbc3365c916f4be3330eb9aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^5 \\cdot 5^{10} \\cdot 15^5 = 243000000000000000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"281\" height=\"17\" />. Counting, we have the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/8/e48724ebe5601e60de46127204e46faf22d0ca8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }18}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"65\" height=\"30\" />\n~andliu766\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Similar_to_Solution_1.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Similar_to_Solution_1)\">Solution 3 (Similar to Solution 1)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Similar to Solution 1)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>All the exponents have a common factor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> which we can factor out. This leaves us with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/e/20e63ab2c23bd9153d06cfbe5bd942c666973791.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(8 \\cdot 5^2 \\cdot 15)^5 = (3000)^5 = (3 \\cdot 1000)^5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"280\" height=\"21\" />. We can then distribute the power leaving us with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/0/ed0983bfd4a053f3f2d8d3b3a91289dab47ea0d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^5 \\cdot 10^{3 \\cdot 5} = 243 \\cdot 10^{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"165\" height=\"17\" />. This would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/2/0d283696fa15299ba194e896dd5a3a6c709edde1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$243$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> followed by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> zeros resulting in our answer being <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/3/4733a0003fc2288744c3ed98260842777a6e7f2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15+3=\\text{\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}18}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"132\" height=\"30\" />\n~leon_0iler\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28easy_to_digest.29_by_Power_Solve\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(easy_to_digest)_by_Power_Solve\">Video Solution (easy to digest) by Power Solve</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (easy to digest) by Power Solve\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Od1Spf3TDBs\">https://youtu.be/Od1Spf3TDBs</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_CosineMethod_.5B.F0.9F.94.A5Fast_and_Easy.F0.9F.94.A5.5D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_CosineMethod_[🔥Fast_and_Easy🔥]\">Video Solution by CosineMethod [🔥Fast and Easy🔥]</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by CosineMethod [🔥Fast and Easy🔥]\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=laHiorWO1zo\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=laHiorWO1zo</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/MFPSxqtguQo\">https://youtu.be/MFPSxqtguQo</a>\n</p><p>~Steven Chen (Professor Chen Education Palace, www.professorchenedu.com)\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28.E2.9A.A1_Under_2_min_.E2.9A.A1.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(⚡_Under_2_min_⚡)\">Video Solution (⚡ Under 2 min ⚡)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (⚡ Under 2 min ⚡)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Xy8vyymlPBg\">https://youtu.be/Xy8vyymlPBg</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_Fast_and_Easy_by_DR.GOOGLE\">Video Solution Fast and Easy by DR.GOOGLE</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution Fast and Easy by DR.GOOGLE\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q6-MiP6ZTYs\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q6-MiP6ZTYs</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_10A\" title=\"2023 AMC 10A\">2023 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2023 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2023 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2023 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2023 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" sty